==Chests==
There are a total of 13 [[chests]] at Haunted Castle:
* 5 Silver Chests.
* 5 Golden Chests.
* 3 Diamond Chests, inside the crow's nest located on top of the castle's flag pole.

==Trivia==
* Before [[Updates/17|Update 17]], players could get bones from [[enemies]] when they killed one around their [[level]].
* The background music of Haunted Castle is the same as that of [[Floating Turtle]]'s and [[Castle on the Sea]]'s background music.
* Haunted Castle is a good place to grind chests for money. After the player travels to the top of the flag and collects the chests, they can go to the stone hut where the [[Death King]] NPC is located and collects the two golden chests there. In total, this can give the player around {{Money|31,750}} to{{Money|46,400}} in total. If the player server hops, they can earn more money — provided someone else hasn't already collected the chests on that server.
* The Haunted Castle is the location where players can begin and complete the [[Skull Guitar/Puzzle|Skull Guitar Puzzle]].
* The Haunted Castle is similar to [[Cursed Ship]].
** Both are horror-themed locations.
** Both have a Raid Boss, being [[Soul Reaper]] here and [[Cursed Captain]] at the [[Cursed Ship]]. The [[Cursed Captain]] and the [[Soul Reaper]] both drop mastery instead of levels.
* There is an altar with blue flames on the way to the cemetery, which is on the left side of the island. It is used to summon the [[Soul Reaper]] by placing a [[Hallow Essence]] on it.
* The [[Uzoth]] NPC used to be found here inside the right gear behind the castle, but was moved to [[Dragon Dojo]] in [[Hydra Island]] in [[Updates/24|Update 24]].
* The island cannot be seen with max graphics quality from nearby islands ([[Port Town]], [[Castle on the Sea]], [[Tiki Outpost]]), only can be seen when close to it.
* Exploiters can be found at this island grinding all the npcs for bones to give to Death King.

